# .gitignore

### Node.js / Package Management\nnode_modules/\npnpm-debug.log\nyarn-debug.log\n.yarn-integrity\npackage-lock.json\n\n### Environment Variables\n.env\n.env.local\n.env.development.local\n.env.test.local\n.env.production.local\n\n### Build Outputs\ndist/\nbuild/\n!.gitignore\n\n### Logs & Temporary Files\n*.log\nlogs/\ntmp/\ntmp/\n\n### IDE & Editor Files\n.vscode/\n.idea/\n*.swp\n*.swo\n*~\n\n### OS & System Files\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n*\*.DS_Store\n\n### Configuration\nsettings.json\nsettings.ini\n*.cfg\n\n### Personal Files\n*.key\n*.pem\n\n### Archive Files\n*.zip\n*.tar.gz\n*.7z\n\n### Web Assets (if generated)\n*.manifest\n*.service-worker.js\n\n### Test Outputs\n.coverage\n.nyc_output/\n\n### IDE/backups\n*.bak\n\n### OS temporary\n/tmp/\nvar/\n\n### Runtime\n*.runtime-cache\n\n### Capacitor/Cordova\ncapacitor.config.json\n\n### SwiftUI preview\n.preview/\n\n